  "Posted 'Boba w/ gun' dested Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; '4-Lom w/ gun' dested 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Dengar w/ gun' dested Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'Ig-88 w/ gun' dested IG-88 With Riot Gun (the strategy counts nine characters with built-in weapons).",
  "Posted 'Death Star Docking Bay', 'Endor Docking Bay' and 'Coruscant Docking Bay' dested the Dark docking bays; 'Cloud City Docking Bay' dested Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay), the only Dark Cloud City docking bay. Vibro-Ax dested the Dark Jabba's Palace weapon.",
